# Inquisitive Glimmer's "unlock costs" are the Room special action (CR 709.5e) and no other: turning a cloaked card face up
# for its mana cost (CR 701.58c, 116.2b) is not one, so Branchsnap Lorian's {1}{G}{G} stays three mana. Turn 1: Mox Pearl
# and Mox Sapphire pay for the Glimmer, and Forest and Mox Emerald, which the reduction would let pay {G}{G}, are short.
# Turn 3: with the moxen untapped a third source is there, and it is paid in full.

